   "inside_central_90": 3,
   "of": 3,
   "reading": "no slice lands outside the central 90% band on either statistic, and the percentiles spread 11-89% for drawdown and 18-87% for peak, which is what a single path per window looks like when the simulator is not biased. The simulator still shows no sign of manufacturing distress, and the tape's full path at the 38th percentile is joined by three slices that are unremarkable in both directions.",
   "what_it_does_not_do": "three correlated windows of one history are not three draws. They cannot estimate the model's error, they cannot check the death tail, and they inherit the full tape's survivorship because wide was selected on it."
  }
